   "id": "r10",
   "page": 1,
   "source": "layout-regroup",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "text": "‘Wilwash’ is a smooth-skinned round potato with white\nflesh and white skin. It has few flowers with white corolla\nand the lightsprout base anthocyanin is blue-violet. It is\ndistinct from known varieties in having the following\ncombination of characters: leaflets absent or few in the\naxils of the inflorescence, short flowering period, eartier\nplant maturity.",
